## LLM (Anthropic)

The agent thinks with Claude via `@wappa/anthropic`. Set `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` in
`.env` (create a key at <https://console.anthropic.com/>). To change models,
pass `new AnthropicProvider({ model: '...' })` in `src/index.ts`.
